    "title": "Valor Ecclesiasticus (1535): a sample of the index layer and Ecton's figures",
    "description": "A sample from the Valor Ecclesiasticus dataset (https://docuracy.github.io/valor/): two institutions in Hertfordshire with their deaneries and dioceses, and one religious house with five of its possession lines. The records are as published there, as printed in the 1810-1834 edition, with editorial fields marked as such. The two institutions carry the King's Books value and the tenths as printed by Ecton in 1763. The dataset withholds its own 1535 figures until they are checked, so none is shown. Licence of these layers: CC BY-NC 4.0.",
    "contributor": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3060-0181",
    "licence": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/",
    "status": "draft",
    "version": "sample-2026-11"
  },
